openssl_sign has $signature parameter that by reference that can re-used, eg:

```php
        $pkeyid = "some_public_key";
	openssl_sign("blah", $signature, $pkeyid);
 
        return $signature;
```

A bunch of minor fixes.

- robots and security headers;
- sitemap auto generation on build;
- mobile app name changed;
- android and web icons changed;
- ios and web splash screen.

